This directory contains a source-derived calibration dataset.

Underlying source text:
- EMA-published SmPC / Product Information text: © European Medicines Agency,
  reproduced under EMA's content-reproduction policy with source acknowledgment.
- URPL / Polish national product-information text, where present: subject to
  applicable source-specific public-sector information reuse rules and original
  provenance.

Compilation, selection, extraction scripts, chunking logic and dataset structure:
© Łukasz Minarowski / navimed-umb.

This directory (`calibration/`) is NOT distributed under the repository's root
CC-BY-4.0 (text) or MIT (code) licenses. The dataset as a whole is distributed
under source-specific reuse terms. It is not distributed under CC-BY-4.0 or
CC-BY-NC-4.0.

Users are responsible for preserving source attribution and checking
source-specific restrictions before redistribution or downstream use.
